        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Fusion AJ-E1, Square Twist Lever With Scalloped Rose</b></P>\r\n<p>Fusion Hardware's Square Twist Lever with Scalloped Rose is a perfect marriage of hard and soft.  Made out of solid brass, it is finished in oil rubbed bronze. It will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Fusion AJ-E1 Square Twist Lever With Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for Traditional Door Lever Fusion AJ E1:\r\n<UL>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Oil Rubbed Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</LI>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</LI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><B>When Selecting a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
